<title>USA: CRW Financial sets 3-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>CRW Financial sets 3-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>KING OF PRUSSIA, Pa. 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>CRW Financial Inc said on Thursday it will split its common stock on a three-for-one basis.</p>
<p>The stock split will be effective October 24, 1996 to CRW shareholders of record on October 14, the company said.</p>
